  Title: PostFX Lab
  Try: "Pick an effect and play it, then the hit, the slow-mo and the low-health
    pulse \u2014 and stack them."
  See: "Each item weighs its own overlay volume above the scene's volume; the later
    prepared sits on top (the hit over the pulse). The slow-mo's desaturation runs
    on the unscaled clock. Leaving the scene reverts every effect. Tab turns every
    category off \u2014 the slow-mo too."
  Controls: "1 2 3 \xB7 Gamepad South West North \u2014 hit \xB7 slow-mo \xB7 low
    health \xB7 Z X C \xB7 D-pad \u2014 pick \xB7 play \xB7 V \u2014 stop all"
